 2, node 1 is connected to node 2, and node 2 is connected to node 3.  A bo=
x labeled 'node' points to node 0, indicating the starting point of the DFS=
. The right side depicts the DFS process. A box labeled 'cloned_node' point=
s to a dashed-line circled node 0, representing a copy of the starting node=
