<h3 id=3D"complexity-analysis">Complexity Analysis</h3>
<p><strong>Time complexity:</strong> The time complexity of <code>graph_dee=
p_copy</code> is <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math x=
mlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo =
stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=3D"fals=
e">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">O(n+e)</annotati=
on></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true=
"><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut" style=3D"height: 1em; vertical=
-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal" style=3D"margin-ri=
ght: 0.02778em;">O</span><span class=3D"mopen">(</span><span class=3D"mord =
mathnormal">n</span><span class=3D"mspace" style=3D"margin-right: 0.2222em;=
"></span><span class=3D"mbin">+</span><span class=3D"mspace" style=3D"margi=
n-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut=
" style=3D"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class=3D"mor=
d mathnormal">e</span><span class=3D"mclose">)</span></span></span></span>,=
 where <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"ht=
tp://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annota=
tion encoding=3D"application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math></span=
><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"base"><span=
 class=3D"strut" style=3D"height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class=3D"mord mat=
hnormal">n</span></span></span></span> is the number of nodes and <span cla=
ss=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/=
1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=3D=
"application/x-tex">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"=
katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut"=
 style=3D"height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal">e</span=
></span></span></span> is the number of edges of the graph. This is because=
 we traverse through and create a clone of all <span class=3D"katex"><span =
class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><=
semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex"=
>n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hi=
