.4306em;"></span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></sp=
an> nodes of the original graph, and traverse across <span class=3D"katex">=
<span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/Mat=
hML"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/=
x-tex">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" a=
ria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut" style=3D"hei=
ght: 0.4306em;"></span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal">e</span></span></spa=
n></span> edges during DFS.</p>
<p><strong>Space complexity:</strong> The space complexity is <span class=
=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/19=
98/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><mi=
>n</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"applicat=
ion/x-tex">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-=
