<span class=3D"mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span>. In addition,=
 the <code>clone_map</code> hash map stores a key-value pair for each of th=
e <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://=
